b:[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border bg-[#eef3f8] py-16 text-slate-900 sm:py-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 opacity-70 [background-image:radial-gradient(circle_at_88%_12%,rgba(14,116,144,0.12),transparent_32%),radial-gradient(circle_at_10%_80%,rgba(37,99,235,0.10),transparent_36%)]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site relative","children":[["$","$L1a",null,{"href":"/highlights/blogs","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-700 hover:text-teal-800","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left size-4"}],"All articles"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-4xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors border-transparent bg-secondary/10 text-secondary dark:text-blue-300","children":"Artificial Intelligence"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-heading text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl","children":"4 Benefits of Learning AI for Career"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-600","children":"From the high-tech systems installed in your car to your daily social media feed, you remain surrounded by AI-powered devices and elements everywhere. And, guess what, AI is only going to undergo exponential growth.…"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-500","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"CITIS InfoTech Editorial"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M8 2v3","key":"1ioesn"}],["path",{"d":"M16 2v3","key":"otl347"}],["rect",{"x":"3","y":"3","width":"18","height":"18","rx":"2","key":"h1oib"}],["path",{"d":"M3 9h18","key":"1pudct"}],["path",{"d":"M8 13h.01","key":"1sbv64"}],["path",{"d":"M12 13h.01","key":"y0uutt"}],["path",{"d":"M16 13h.01","key":"wip0gl"}],["path",{"d":"M8 17h.01","key":"p3bg7i"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01","key":"p32p05"}],["path",{"d":"M16 17h.01","key":"ql8jdd"}]],"className":"lucide-calendar-days size-4"}],"7 November 2021"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"M12 6v6l4 2","key":"mmk7yg"}]],"className":"lucide-clock size-4"}],"4 min read"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#e8edf5] dark:bg-slate-900","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site grid gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_13rem] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[[["$","section","Overview",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Overview"}],[["$","p","From the high-tech systems installed in your car to your daily social media feed, you remain surrounded by AI-powered devices and elements everywhere. And, guess what, AI is only going to undergo exponential growth. As per an industry report, by 2030, AI will contribute over USD 15 trillion to the global economy. These factors make AI an exciting career space. Accordingly, this article explores the benefits of learning AI for a career.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"From the high-tech systems installed in your car to your daily social media feed, you remain surrounded by AI-powered devices and elements everywhere. And, guess what, AI is only going to undergo exponential growth. As per an industry report, by 2030, AI will contribute over USD 15 trillion to the global economy. These factors make AI an exciting career space. Accordingly, this article explores the benefits of learning AI for a career."}]]]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"],"$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]}]]}],"$L23","$L24"]
1c:["$","section","AI is the Breakthrough Technology and the Skill of the Century!",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"AI is the Breakthrough Technology and the Skill of the Century!"}],[["$","p","AI is slated to revolutionize the world and replace a lot of human jobs. However, alongside replacing human jobs, it will create a lot of new jobs across several industries. You will experience the power of AI in every profession, and interestingly, this is only the beginning. Accordingly, AI becomes an imperative skill that every individual, regardless of the profession he or she is in, must learn to ensure new-age professional competence.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"AI is slated to revolutionize the world and replace a lot of human jobs. However, alongside replacing human jobs, it will create a lot of new jobs across several industries. You will experience the power of AI in every profession, and interestingly, this is only the beginning. Accordingly, AI becomes an imperative skill that every individual, regardless of the profession he or she is in, must learn to ensure new-age professional competence."}]]]}]
1d:["$","section","Social Application",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Social Application"}],[["$","p","AI is transforming society as well, across both the virtual as well as the physical space. For instance, it is leveraging people and businesses to create a broader outreach and helping users get what they want through social media. On the other hand, its widespread applications across the agriculture sector help farmers make informed investments and grow a better yield. So, AI isn’t just a technology but a social partner.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"AI is transforming society as well, across both the virtual as well as the physical space. For instance, it is leveraging people and businesses to create a broader outreach and helping users get what they want through social media. On the other hand, its widespread applications across the agriculture sector help farmers make informed investments and grow a better yield. So, AI isn’t just a technology but a social partner."}]]]}]
1e:["$","section","Rapid Business Adoption",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Rapid Business Adoption"}],[["$","p","AI’s capabilities contribute to its extensive application across the industry. And, this is something that can be seen through its quick adoption throughout the business world. For instance, according to a Gartner stat published on research.ai, in 2019, 37% of organizations used AI at their workplaces. However, from 2015 – 2019, the adoption number grew by a whopping 270%!",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"AI’s capabilities contribute to its extensive application across the industry. And, this is something that can be seen through its quick adoption throughout the business world. For instance, according to a Gartner stat published on research.ai, in 2019, 37% of organizations used AI at their workplaces. However, from 2015 – 2019, the adoption number grew by a whopping 270%!"}],["$","p","Additionally, as per an MMC Ventures stat published on research.ai, the demand for AI talent has doubled in the last couple of years. The finance and technology companies are currently absorbing more than half of it, precisely 60% of it. However, since AI has ventured into almost every business territory, it becomes a given that you will be required to have AI capabilities to remain a competitive and relevant contender for modern jobs.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Additionally, as per an MMC Ventures stat published on research.ai, the demand for AI talent has doubled in the last couple of years. The finance and technology companies are currently absorbing more than half of it, precisely 60% of it. However, since AI has ventured into almost every business territory, it becomes a given that you will be required to have AI capabilities to remain a competitive and relevant contender for modern jobs."}]]]}]
1f:["$","section","AI Career Opportunities",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"AI Career Opportunities"}],[["$","p","AI’s futuristic significance and relevance make it a critical element of almost every career option. Some of the existing and future AI jobs include working as an AI Data Analyst, Research Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, Data Scientist, Business Intelligence Developer, Big Data Engineer, and Product Manager.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"AI’s futuristic significance and relevance make it a critical element of almost every career option. Some of the existing and future AI jobs include working as an AI Data Analyst, Research Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, Data Scientist, Business Intelligence Developer, Big Data Engineer, and Product Manager."}],["$","p","Besides, sectors such as healthcare, agriculture, manufacturing, and the creative industry also will see a lot of AI coming their way soon. So, if you want to be a part of the exciting AI-based future, you must learn it.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Besides, sectors such as healthcare, agriculture, manufacturing, and the creative industry also will see a lot of AI coming their way soon. So, if you want to be a part of the exciting AI-based future, you must learn it."}]]]}]
20:["$","section","CITIS – The Leading EduTech Company in India",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"CITIS – The Leading EduTech Company in India"}],[["$","p","On the one hand, where AI strengthens its grip over the future, on the other, if India wants to become a leading AI player, its education sector must start building the capacity to ensure competitive AI learning. It includes creating the right AI training infrastructure in the form of AI training programs, the inclusion of AI in the school curriculum, practical exposure to the technology, etc. Here, CITIS, the leading EduTech company steps is.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"On the one hand, where AI strengthens its grip over the future, on the other, if India wants to become a leading AI player, its education sector must start building the capacity to ensure competitive AI learning. It includes creating the right AI training infrastructure in the form of AI training programs, the inclusion of AI in the school curriculum, practical exposure to the technology, etc. Here, CITIS, the leading EduTech company steps is."}],["$","p","CITIS handholds educators throughout the country to develop online and classroom AI training courses, conduct certification programs, and build the learning capacity through incubation centers established throughout various institutes. With end-to-end AI learning assistance, the company proves itself to be a comprehensive AI education partner. For more details, connect with CITIS at +91 20 2567 70 60.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"CITIS handholds educators throughout the country to develop online and classroom AI training courses, conduct certification programs, and build the learning capacity through incubation centers established throughout various institutes. With end-to-end AI learning assistance, the company proves itself to be a comprehensive AI education partner. For more details, connect with CITIS at +91 20 2567 70 60."}]]]}]
